# 💻 C++ Core & Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) Portfolio

Welcome to my C++ development repository! This space showcases practical, real-world console applications built from scratch using **Modern C++**, focusing on clean code architecture, data structures, and persistent file storage.

---

## 📂 Featured Projects in This Repository

### 1. 🏦 Banking & ATM Management System (`bank_management_system.cpp`)
An Object-Oriented banking simulation system designed to handle customer accounts and financial transactions securely.
* **Key Features:** Account creation (Savings/Current), instant deposits, overdraft-protected withdrawals, balance inquiry, and admin account directory.
* **Concepts Used:** Classes & Objects, Encapsulation, String Parsing, STL Vectors, and File Handling (`bank_records.txt`).

### 2. 💰 Personal Finance & Budget Tracker (`budget_tracker.cpp`)
A lightweight financial utility to track daily cash flow, categorize expenses, and prevent overspending.
* **Key Features:** Categorized income/expense logging, automated balance validation, tabular transaction history, and automatic data saving.
* **Concepts Used:** Structures (`struct`), Formatted I/O (`iomanip`), File Streams (`fstream`), and Control Loops.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack & Core Competencies
* **Language:** C++ (C++11 / C++17)
* **Programming Paradigms:** Procedural & Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)
* **Core Tools & Libraries:** STL (`<vector>`, `<string>`, `<iomanip>`), File I/O (`<fstream>`), GCC / G++ Compiler

